cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Genômica comparativa e ontogenia em Archosauria: Gallus gallus frente a Alligator mississippiensis e Crocodylus porosus"
message: "If you use this analysis, please cite it and the underlying primary data sources listed in docs/relatorio_archosauria.md."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Reproducible comparative-genomics pipeline contrasting the chicken genome with
  three crocodilian genomes. Quantifies the avian substitution-rate acceleration
  from a 39-gene 1:1 ortholog supermatrix, the karyotype and GC compartmentation
  of microchromosomes, and conserved non-coding elements across the four Hox
  clusters.
keywords:
  - Archosauria
  - comparative genomics
  - molecular evolution
  - microchromosomes
  - conserved non-coding elements
  - evo-devo
license: MIT
